@thepantproject 

(Malai pants, the pant project, office wear for boys, trousers)

@thepantproject challenged me to test out their anti-spill pants. Let’s find out…

Putting their Water Repellent Pants to the ultimate test to see if the Smart-Tech fabric actually holds up. From sneaker-spray-level stain resistance to a stretchable waistband and zero-iron wrinkle-free material, these are built for everyday wear without the stress. Most importantly, the clean, tailored fit sits perfectly over the kicks. Challenge passed.

[anti-spill pants, tech pants, water repellent pants, The Pant Project, sneakerhead fashion, everyday menswear, stretch chinos, wrinkle-free pants, sneaker style, streetwear fit, men’s utility pants]

30 washes later. Still black. Still comfy. Still in rotation.

#denim #fashion #style #jeans #nofade 

{brand collab, black jeans, denim, styling, outfits, good fabric, comfort, mobility, black, no fade, quality, pants, stretchable}
